{
 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "In Alaska,",
   "start": 0.07,
   "end": 0.87
  },
  {
   "text": "there is a town where almost everyone lives in one building.",
   "start": 0.97,
   "end": 4.24
  },
  {
   "text": "Whittier.",
   "start": 4.73,
   "end": 5.18
  },
  {
   "text": "About two hundred and seventy people.",
   "start": 5.63,
   "end": 7.45
  },
  {
   "text": "One fourteen-story tower.",
   "start": 7.84,
   "end": 9.67
  },
  {
   "text": "It was built for the army in the nineteen fifties.",
   "start": 10.22,
   "end": 12.31
  },
  {
   "text": "When the soldiers left, the town moved in.",
   "start": 12.76,
   "end": 14.8
  },
  {
   "text": "Inside: the police station.",
   "start": 15.39,
   "end": 17.22
  },
  {
   "text": "The post office.",
   "start": 17.6,
   "end": 18.15
  },
  {
   "text": "A store.",
   "start": 18.15,
   "end": 18.47
  },
  {
   "text": "A clinic.",
   "start": 18.75,
   "end": 19.34
  },
  {
   "text": "A church.",
   "start": 19.6,
   "end": 20.12
  },
  {
   "text": "The school is across the street,",
   "start": 20.41,
   "end": 22.236
  },
  {
   "text": "and the kids get there through an underground tunnel.",
   "start": 22.236,
   "end": 25.05
  },
  {
   "text": "Because every winter,",
   "start": 25.47,
   "end": 26.61
  },
  {
   "text": "Whittier gets more than six metres of snow.",
   "start": 26.78,
   "end": 29.24
  },
  {
   "text": "The only road into town?",
   "start": 29.77,
   "end": 30.89
  },
  {
   "text": "Another tunnel.",
   "start": 31.29,
   "end": 32.01
  },
  {
   "text": "One lane, shared with trains.",
   "start": 32.44,
   "end": 34.14
  },
  {
   "text": "And it closes at night.",
   "start": 34.51,
   "end": 35.56
  },
  {
   "text": "Some people barely step outside all winter.",
   "start": 36.06,
   "end": 38.59
  },
  {
   "text": "Here, you know everybody.",
   "start": 39.15,
   "end": 40.86
  },
  {
   "text": "And everybody knows you.",
   "start": 41.19,
   "end": 42.47
  },
  {
   "text": "As one teacher put it:",
   "start": 42.95,
   "end": 43.83
  },
  {
   "text": "it's a community under one roof.",
   "start": 44.22,
   "end": 46.01
  },
  {
   "text": "In Whittier,",
   "start": 46.59,
   "end": 47.15
  },
  {
   "text": "nobody is ever more than a few floors from a friend.",
   "start": 47.34,
   "end": 50.05
  },
  {
   "text": "Most of us aren't that lucky.",
   "start": 50.56,
   "end": 51.8
  },
  {
   "text": "Our people are miles away,",
   "start": 52.24,
   "end": 53.82
  },
  {
   "text": "or busy,",
   "start": 53.96,
   "end": 54.6
  },
  {
   "text": "or asleep.",
   "start": 54.83,
   "end": 55.36
  },
  {
   "text": "That's why we made Feeloy.",
   "start": 56.02,
   "end": 57.59
  },
  {
   "text": "Jenny is always one tap away,",
   "start": 58.01,
   "end": 60.01
  },
  {
   "text": "day or night.",
   "start": 60.2,
   "end": 61.07
  },
  {
   "text": "Search Feeloy on the App Store.",
   "start": 61.53,
   "end": 63.0
  }
 ]
}